# The Docker build only needs c/ (engine sources + launcher). Everything else
# is either huge, host-specific, or irrelevant to the image.
.git
web/node_modules
web/dist
site
docs
**/*.o
**/*.exe
# c/syntara is the Python launcher (source), not a build artifact -- the
# Dockerfile.slim COPYs it and asserts on it at build time, so it must stay
# in the context. ENGINE_REAL builds the POSIX engine to c/glm below.
c/glm
c/olmoe
c/glm_tiny
**/.syntara_usage
**/.syntara_kv*
**/__pycache__
*.safetensors
*.log
CODEX-BRIEF.md
wt-inc4
